{"articleNo":"157388","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=157388&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[K-RC교육원] K-RC교육원생들을 위한 종합구충제 배부 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2016.09.06","hit":"2825","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt\"><strong>K-RC교육원에서는 생활관생들의 감염병 예방 및 건강보호를 위하여 종합구충제를 배부하오니, </strong></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt\"><strong>해당 기간 내에 수령하시기 바랍니다.</strong></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt\"></span></p><p><strong></strong>&nbsp;</p><p><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt\"><strong>1. 대상 : 생활관 전체 관생</strong></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt\"></span></p><p><strong></strong>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt\"><strong>2. 기간 : <font style=\"BACKGROUND-COLOR: #ffffff\" color=\"#0900ff\">2016. 9. 19.(월)~9. 23.(금) 9:00~18:00</font></strong></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt\"><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; [(점심시간 12:00~13:00제외)]</strong></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt\"></span></p><p><strong></strong>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt\"><strong>3. 장소 : <font color=\"#0900ff\">의료지원실(학생회관 103호)</font></strong></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt\"></span></p><p><strong></strong>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt\"><strong>4. 방법 : <font color=\"#0900ff\">생활관생 본인이 직접 방문하여 수령(1인 1정)</font></strong></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt\"></span></p><p><strong></strong>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt\">5. 효능</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt; FONT-FAMILY: 함초롬바탕; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0.0pt\">·</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt\">효과</span></strong></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt\"><strong>&nbsp; - 회충, 요충, 십이지장충, 편충, 아메리카구충, 분선충의 감염 및 </strong></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt\"><strong>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 이들 혼합감염의 치료</strong></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt\"></span></p><p><strong></strong>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt\"><strong>6. 복용법</strong></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt\"><strong>&nbsp; - 1회 1정을 씹어먹거나 물로 삼킴</strong></span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt\"><strong></strong></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt\"><strong></strong></span>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt\"><strong>2016. 9. 6.</strong></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 18pt\"><strong>K-RC교육원장</strong></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
